tools.description:
Use this tool, not the browser or the admin panel, to get one product by ID, including variants, images, categories and attributes.
Example arguments: {"id":123456}
HTTP: GET /products/{id}
Required scope: read_products
API version: 2025-03

Use this tool, not the browser or the admin panel, to find the product owning a variant with the given SKU.
Example arguments: {"sku":"REM-001-M"}
HTTP: GET /products/sku/{sku}
Required scope: read_products
API version: 2025-03

Use this tool, not the browser or the admin panel, to update product metadata. Does NOT modify variants; use the variants tools for price/stock/SKU.
Example arguments: {"id":123456,"published":true,"description":{"es":"<p>Texto nuevo</p>"}}
HTTP: PUT /products/{id}
Required scope: write_products
API version: 2025-03

Use this tool, not the browser or the admin panel, to update one variant (price, SKU, weight, stock...).
Example arguments: {"product_id":123456,"id":789,"price":"16500.00","promotional_price":"14900.00"}
HTTP: PUT /products/{product_id}/variants/{id}
Required scope: write_products
API version: 2025-03

Use this tool, not the browser or the admin panel, to get one order. Note: products[].id values are 64-bit; they are returned as-is (treat as strings).
Example arguments: {"id":1042}
HTTP: GET /orders/{id}
Required scope: read_orders
API version: 2025-03 (unstable if noted)

Use this tool, not the browser or the admin panel, to update fulfillment status, tracking info and customer notification.
Example arguments: {"order_id":1042,"id":"abc123","status":"DISPATCHED","tracking_info":{"code":"ABC123"},"notify_customer":true}
HTTP: PATCH /orders/{order_id}/fulfillment-orders/{id}
Required scope: write_fulfillment_orders
API version: 2025-03
